  scriptedFlavorTexts:
  - The dragon slashes at {mc}, which he tries to block.
  - The dragon breathes curving fireballs at {mc}, which he also tries to block.
  - The dragon, frustrated with {mc}'s shield, attempts to melt it through a concentrated
    stream of flame.
  - With the shield to hot to hold onto, the dragon fires out three pillars of fire
    breath.
  - The dragon breathes out multiple more streams of fire breath.
  - The dragon attempts to use even more streams of fire breath, deciding to focus
    on blasting from above.
