  randomFlavorTexts:
  - The dragon tries to bite Sayori.
  - The dragon tries to bite {mc}.
  - The dragon breathes pillars of fire at Sayori.
  - The dragon slams his wings down around {mc}, attempting to snort little blasts
    of fire at him.
  - The dragon slams one of his feet down onto Sayori's foot, and breathes fire breath
    at her.
  - The dragon tries to breath multiple fireballs at {mc}, which he attempts to block.
  - The dragon tries the curving fireball trick again, with {mc} blocking once more.
  - The dragon rains down orange fire at the both of them from above.
  - The dragon rains down blue fire at the both of them from above.
  - The dragon tries to fire smaller, wriggling fireballs at Sayori.
  maxHealth: 200
